  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a large pot, combine water and cranberries. Bring to a boil, reduce heat, and simmer for 30 minutes. Add sugar, orange juice, lemon juice, cloves, and cinnamon sticks. Cover and steep for 1 hour.",
